Subject: [PATCH] Wayland backend: the output is the internal display

Nested in DroidNux's compositor, KWin's output is the device's own screen.
As an internal output it gets the internal brightness device powerdevil
registers (kde_external_brightness_v1): Plasma's brightness controls the
backlight DroidNux maps to Android's.
---
diff --git a/src/backends/wayland/wayland_output.cpp b/src/backends/wayland/wayland_output.cpp
--- a/src/backends/wayland/wayland_output.cpp
+++ b/src/backends/wayland/wayland_output.cpp
@@ -111,6 +111,7 @@
     setInformation(Information{
         .name = name,
         .model = name,
         .capabilities = Capability::Dpms,
+        .internal = true,
     });
 
